            <div xml:id="m-7841d01f-4254-497f-bf16-1619581d6837">
              <lg xml:id="m-926c2134-50a2-4a80-8c61-404879c8acaa">
                <l xml:id="m-73fb4f31-01f5-43ea-96c0-1bd548503168" facs="#m-a556dcc5-4ec2-4a39-aaa6-f2b3777cd6e1" label="ambiguous">300</l><l xml:id="m-208c7a0d-6e62-471a-8bb5-0726e7fc0afd" facs="#m-b984042e-3c04-4e06-bab0-03ed3bf7ceaf" label="text-like">Thursday at Compline.</l><l xml:id="m-5e48dfef-45e4-41be-babe-964e3556c6b6" facs="#m-5330a746-b7bd-4fa4-b6ad-76648af60b28" label="ambiguous">Psalm 70. H.</l><l xml:id="m-85b57dae-73f9-4e27-a845-9a83faf43d5b" facs="#m-6eeb0063-53cb-4ff9-a700-1dce668a4561" label="lyrics-like">vOnfundántur et defíciant detrahéntes ánimae méae: *operiántur</l><l xml:id="m-f055feba-b194-49ac-bfba-07960b270b88" facs="#m-68f42d1a-647b-44a0-8b6b-daa8279f029c" label="lyrics-like">Lconfusióne et pudóre qui quaérunt mála mihi.</l><l xml:id="m-3c670839-e468-47ed-9259-46b73a870406" facs="#m-fe1d6664-4410-4271-9f03-bb26218fdaca" label="lyrics-like">2. Ego autem semper sperábo:* et adjiciam super ómnem láudem</l><l xml:id="m-d2092020-652e-4b0d-94d7-81bfcc4c59d4" facs="#m-0e9124f0-a6a0-402c-95ea-4937e9bf33c1" label="lyrics-like">túam.</l><l xml:id="m-4f32b4a7-9cb8-4764-8bf8-e3c8b39f5be8" facs="#m-e677a699-d7b2-4c59-8734-90f2e0678925" label="lyrics-like">3. Os méum annuntiábit justitiam túam: “tóta díe salutáre túum.</l><l xml:id="m-e4267218-cbb6-42be-9480-b05ece25260b" facs="#m-873b104d-2c15-4990-bef7-ad3d9f571870" label="lyrics-like">4. Quóniam non cognóvi litteratúram, t introibo in poténtias Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-9518e966-b065-43a3-9af0-edd69b12d288" facs="#m-a201689f-42d3-457e-ac20-1eef05b85b44" label="lyrics-like">ni:"Dómine, memorábor justitiae túae solius.</l><l xml:id="m-c6cbd2a6-42a0-4b7a-9bbc-3fe1bc6d4e60" facs="#m-ad0d08ac-beca-4587-93f7-2bfe91e00589" label="lyrics-like">5. Déus docuisti me a juventúte méa: “ et usque nunc pronuntiábo</l><l xml:id="m-f335b4ef-4c51-4394-8ac0-ac9079a37309" facs="#m-fd6f0a28-a53d-4c80-b978-a34c2f38caa5" label="lyrics-like">mirabilia túa.</l><l xml:id="m-b35c6f5a-2ba4-43f8-8e69-c856a0c46904" facs="#m-b684600a-f537-4752-b057-9a5aeb1823a6" label="lyrics-like">6. Et usque in senéctam et sénium, * Déus ne derelinquas me,</l><l xml:id="m-8f624c21-70cd-49cf-8a72-926a4de497d7" facs="#m-5a7c24e9-bfdf-4215-9772-666383d60ef1" label="lyrics-like">7. Donec annúntiem bráchium túum * generatióni ómni quae</l><l xml:id="m-1cb83729-0dc2-4b6e-ae16-37a938d17803" facs="#m-1a09f56c-57ec-48ce-bee7-32afcb685020" label="lyrics-like">ventúra est:</l><l xml:id="m-9779bfb4-9901-4e2b-95be-e0a707b7acd4" facs="#m-fdddf8a2-1ecd-4681-bbea-ef1e7c99e59e" label="lyrics-like">8. Poténtiam túam et justítiam túam Déus, t usque in altissima quae</l><l xml:id="m-1fc65f62-a35a-40b4-ab82-48917d833527" facs="#m-4b065bb6-6930-41b1-b633-aeed08261b5b" label="lyrics-like">fecisti magnália:“Déus, quis similis tibi?</l><l xml:id="m-27c22a52-15f7-4ec7-ab69-1db2e62bf298" facs="#m-1d17fef9-8955-4b2e-9cb4-45749ba53e16" label="lyrics-like">9. Quántas ostendísti míhi tribulatiónes múltas et málas: t et con¬</l><l xml:id="m-83a9a4e0-f4d0-4f65-9b2a-d8a74b38cd82" facs="#m-1d64e339-73fd-4b1c-937f-3f44244641bf" label="lyrics-like">vérsus vivificásti me:t de abyssis térrae iterum reduxisti me.</l><l xml:id="m-d194d61a-a64f-4c69-9159-416887219bc7" facs="#m-391b8bc5-6260-45fb-ab3b-37eb9eefc828" label="lyrics-like">10. Multiplicásti magnificéntiam túam: * et convérsus consolátus</l><l xml:id="m-f821d443-2ea0-4d6c-8e06-ac830cb91a2f" facs="#m-9d340e45-de10-4eda-b9a2-f39e31de2012" label="lyrics-like">és me.</l><l xml:id="m-e89924c1-0f61-4103-b6dc-2a8f580482d4" facs="#m-37cb9953-bf06-48d7-aa62-fc3e7b64d145" label="lyrics-like">11. Nam et égo confitébor tibi in vásis psálmi veritátem túam:*</l><l xml:id="m-7c92c2cb-0a9e-467e-ad55-3423b31aea1c" facs="#m-6e16b2a4-a9ed-4ec4-b299-64799b4a87d9" label="lyrics-like">Déus, psállam tibi in cithara, Sánctus Israël¬</l><l xml:id="m-8dffa443-0da3-4aa2-b9b0-fddda27d8439" facs="#m-99263ad4-2c0c-4a0f-a216-83346d5c5519" label="lyrics-like">12. Exsultábunt lábia méa cum cantávero tibi:“et ánima méa,</l><l xml:id="m-2a9b19ef-4994-4c83-8fdb-8f809a53a14a" facs="#m-a236dd73-b703-4a96-a68d-485bbd3bc4ae" label="ambiguous">quam redemisti.</l><l xml:id="m-09918ec4-732a-4451-bf78-6ffea9010041" facs="#m-5e921e65-5278-4412-9303-8988a5802e9e" label="lyrics-like">18. Sed et lingua méa tóta díe meditábitur justítiam túam:“cum</l><l xml:id="m-bd5aa430-e841-435f-b51c-ecba45a682b0" facs="#m-4921349c-8dd6-4be1-91f0-3921333cdb08" label="lyrics-like">confúsi et revériti fúerint qui quaérunt mála mihi.</l><l xml:id="m-0d0b4b03-3b9d-4c9a-bc0b-c397e79222b0" facs="#m-d540dac4-94d3-4d3f-a8d7-6b21668cc2b0" label="lyrics-like">14. Glória Pátri, et Filio, *et Spiritui Sancto.</l><l xml:id="m-93b47a1f-69c3-41c7-8e48-5793975a5bd5" facs="#m-ae10c2a5-c11d-489c-8163-e7e190f64253" label="lyrics-like">18. Sicut érat in princípio, et nunc, et sémper, * et in saécula saccu¬</l><l xml:id="m-4a399377-bd57-47e2-8376-a9cd36e1a8f2" facs="#m-9feea313-3152-4c74-b9b4-d7d080231b4b" label="lyrics-like">lórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-ee28bab9-645f-4b87-a5f7-07db40b8f299" facs="#m-fac94945-32fd-41c6-8659-762d18ce9e67" label="ambiguous">AntE</l><l xml:id="m-ac395fe0-1d44-4fcf-ad84-2711673bd761" facs="#m-60c6f2cd-7058-41ce-8ab8-1d40581ed400" label="lyrics-like">Adjútor mé-us et li-be-rátor mé-us ésto Dómine.</l><l xml:id="m-5f62190c-fc70-40e3-9c28-56e36f087340" facs="#m-ade4ebbc-b4f0-4a86-a10e-11bf05a27118" label="ambiguous">P. T.</l><l xml:id="m-e8104f36-1756-4fe3-9635-e3632a303530" facs="#m-0525b8af-17d1-45fd-97dc-9482c0869d02" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-9e96ddc8-0858-40a0-9d9a-669548a9fb39" facs="#m-46394d38-f16e-4e11-9909-362400200702" label="lyrics-like">Alle-lú-ia, alle-lú-ia, alle-lú-ia.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>